Modifications to the Software (2026-11-03), also listed in docs/thirdparty-patches.md and
thirdparty/dkls23-chp.patch:
  1. src/sign/messages.rs: added read-only accessors on PreSign (chp_s0, chp_s1, chp_phi,
     chp_big_r, chp_public_key, chp_party_id).
  2. Cargo.toml: pinned sl-mpc-mate to =1.0.0-beta.

The library is used by the crates chp-mpc (and, through it, chp-engine-hot,
chp-engine-cold, chp-ceremony and chp-sim) of this repository.
